# headwear/helm/crest/finial: the forge crest accent `finial` (STYLE_P2 28.3, contracts 3c: overlay crest.<v>, anchor crown)
# A big cast ball on a ringed neck over a flange: round, lit at its top-left with a glint, a dark ring where it meets
# the flange.
# Written by the FORGE-HELM area's tools/gen.py from src/ (the hand-drawn D U R views; L is R re-lit). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
body adult
role overlay crest.finial
layer headwear
anchor crown
keys hatpose
z 2
tags overlay
legend v metal 0
legend w metal 1
legend x metal 2
legend y metal 3
legend z metal 4
legend J metal2 0
legend N metal2 1
legend O metal2 2
legend P metal2 3
legend Q metal2 4
legend f leather 0
legend g leather 1
legend h leather 2
legend i leather 3
legend j leather 4
legend 5 cloth1 0
legend 6 cloth1 1
legend 7 cloth1 2
legend 8 cloth1 3
legend 9 cloth1 4
legend F plume 0
legend R plume 1
legend S plume 2
legend T plume 3
legend U plume 4
legend X glow 3
legend W glow 4
legend k cloak 0
legend l cloak 1
legend m cloak 2
legend n cloak 3
legend o cloak 4

