# (HELMS forge-fix i1) the yield moved ahead of the sheen views: the first replacing view that holds wins, so a pale,
# matte, dark, burnished or iridescent alloy on another helm family wore the finial through it
# (FORGE-HEAD i2) crest yield: drawn only on cone onion; any other alloy helm family wears no finial crest
